    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Im looking at `surround.mini`.\r\n\r\nImagine this text:\r\n\r\n```\r\nawoefawef\r\nwaefawefawef\r\nawefawefij foaweif aweofi\r\nwaeifjoaw\r\n[a]wef\r\n```\r\ncursor is on `[a]`. Press `<C-v>gg$sa\"` and I get this:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\"awoefawef\r\n\"waefawefaw\"ef\r\n\"awefawefij\" foaweif aweofi\r\n\"waeifjoaw\r\n\"awef\r\n```\r\n\r\nExpected is:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\"awoefawef\"\r\n\"waefawefawef\"\r\n\"awefawefij foaweif aweofi\"\r\n\"waeifjoaw\"\r\n\"awef\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nI notice this is possible on all the vim based plugins (tpope etc) but not on the two nvim based plugins. Is there a way to do this?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Im looking at <code class=\"notranslate\">surround.mini</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Imagine this text:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"awoefawef\nwaefawefawef\nawefawefij foaweif aweofi\nwaeifjoaw\n[a]wef\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">awoefawef\nwaefawefawef\nawefawefij foaweif aweofi\nwaeifjoaw\n[a]wef\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cursor is on <code class=\"notranslate\">[a]</code>. Press <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-v&gt;gg$sa\"</code> and I get this:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&quot;awoefawef\n&quot;waefawefaw&quot;ef\n&quot;awefawefij&quot; foaweif aweofi\n&quot;waeifjoaw\n&quot;awef\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">\"awoefawef\n\"waefawefaw\"ef\n\"awefawefij\" foaweif aweofi\n\"waeifjoaw\n\"awef\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Expected is:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&quot;awoefawef&quot;\n&quot;waefawefawef&quot;\n&quot;awefawefij foaweif aweofi&quot;\n&quot;waeifjoaw&quot;\n&quot;awef&quot;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">\"awoefawef\"\n\"waefawefawef\"\n\"awefawefij foaweif aweofi\"\n\"waeifjoaw\"\n\"awef\"\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I notice this is possible on all the vim based plugins (tpope etc) but not on the two nvim based plugins. Is there a way to do this?</p>",
    "bodyText": "Im looking at surround.mini.\nImagine this text:\nawoefawef\nwaefawefawef\nawefawefij foaweif aweofi\nwaeifjoaw\n[a]wef\n\ncursor is on [a]. Press <C-v>gg$sa\" and I get this:\n\"awoefawef\n\"waefawefaw\"ef\n\"awefawefij\" foaweif aweofi\n\"waeifjoaw\n\"awef\n\nExpected is:\n\"awoefawef\"\n\"waefawefawef\"\n\"awefawefij foaweif aweofi\"\n\"waeifjoaw\"\n\"awef\"\n\nI notice this is possible on all the vim based plugins (tpope etc) but not on the two nvim based plugins. Is there a way to do this?",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
